				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "xfBuVUXQRHeWLV9o4+IOfg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "A GemStone session sees the database as it was at the start of its current transaction. As long as a session keeps that old view, the stone has to keep the old versions of the objects it might still read, so the repository grows. A session that stays connected and idle for hours, for example one that was simply forgotten, therefore costs space for everybody."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T22:27:02.285904+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T22:27:02.285904+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "aE6YXPeASa2y5KdI6ucYHw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "The keep alive solves this from the image side: a background process that regularly aborts the idle sessions of a session registry, so that their view of the database moves forward. Optionally, it also logs out sessions that stayed connected for too long. It is implemented by {{gtClass:GtGemStoneSessionKeepAlive}}; every session registry has one."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [
									{
										"__type" : "textSnippet",
										"children" : {
											"__type" : "snippets",
											"items" : [ ]
										},
										"createEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"createTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T22:27:02.285939+01:00"
											}
										},
										"editEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"editTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T22:27:02.285939+01:00"
											}
										},
										"uid" : {
											"__type" : "uid",
											"uidString" : "+0rkP3qSS6uefkCr0e0Eww=="
										},
										"paragraphStyle" : {
											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "**No uncommitted changes:** the session is aborted. Nothing is lost, and the session now sees the current state of the database."
									},
									{
										"__type" : "textSnippet",
										"children" : {
											"__type" : "snippets",
											"items" : [ ]
										},
										"createEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"createTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T22:27:02.285942+01:00"
											}
										},
										"editEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"editTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T22:27:02.285942+01:00"
											}
										},
										"uid" : {
											"__type" : "uid",
											"uidString" : "Cd1sa0QKR8+IEwyuEWQFZg=="
										},
										"paragraphStyle" : {
											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "**Uncommitted changes:** the session is left alone, because an abort would throw the changes away. If it still has changes at the next poll ({{gtMethod:GtGemStoneKeepAliveSession>>#isDirty}}), it appears in a notification, so that you can commit or abort it yourself."
									},
									{
										"__type" : "textSnippet",
										"children" : {
											"__type" : "snippets",
											"items" : [ ]
										},
										"createEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"createTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T22:27:02.285945+01:00"
											}
										},
										"editEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"editTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T22:27:02.285945+01:00"
											}
										},
										"uid" : {
											"__type" : "uid",
											"uidString" : "+c2Y2swZQhmt3Ppb8InxQA=="
										},
										"paragraphStyle" : {
											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "**Busy, or not in automatic transaction mode:** the session is skipped and looked at again at the next poll ({{gtMethod:GtGemStoneSessionKeepAlive>>#canPollSession:}})."
									}
								]
							},
