								"uidString" : "qu5GKKemRommhrb7JH9FPg=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The keep alive does not take care of a session forever. Each connector has a *max keep alive*, by default 120 minutes after the session connected ({{gtMethod:GtGemStoneSessionKeepAlive class>>#maxKeepAlive}}). What happens when it is reached depends on whether the connector has auto-logout enabled (it is off by default, see {{gtMethod:GtGemStoneGciConnector>>#initialize}}):"
						},
