				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# Connection history\n\nEach time a session connects, it starts a new connection record ({{gtClass:GtGemStoneSessionConnectionRecord}}). The record holds when the connection started, what the keep alive did with it (aborts, changes found, postponements) and, once it is over, how it ended: closed by the user, logged out by the keep alive, or lost because the gem was stopped or the network went down. A lost connection is also reported in a notification.\n\nThe records are kept in three places, so that a disconnect can still be traced afterwards:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
