							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Inspect the session registry: the *Keep alive* view shows the state of every session (last poll, changes, time left before a logout), and the *Sessions* view lets you postpone a pending logout. The *Keep alive* view of a single session shows its details. The GemStone sessions card on the home page marks the sessions with a pending logout and can postpone them too. The examples in {{gtClass:GtGemStoneSessionKeepAliveExamples}} walk through each case step by step."
